<title>SINGAPORE: ST Automotive '96 net profit up 28.9 pct.</title>
<headline>ST Automotive '96 net profit up 28.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     17.31 vs  13.43</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)			3.70 vs   2.78</p>
<p>    Special bonus dividend		1.25 vs   1.25</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		    14.00 vs  11.00</p>
<p>    Turnover				228.23 vs 175.89</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	 7.14 vs   4.77</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		    0.15 vs   0.74</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)		5.65 vs   7.22</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	     5.72 vs   3.01</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  8.15 vs   8.81</p>
<p>    Tax					 5.41 vs   4.74</p>
<p>    Minorities (loss)		     0.14 vs   0.00</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries (loss)		0.73 vs   0.41</p>
<p>Note - Singapore Technologies Automotive Ltd</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
